  </Box>
  <Box style={{ height: 520, marginTop: 20, flexDirection: 'row' }}>
    <Box style={{ width: 340, justifyContent: 'flex-start' }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#6B7280', lineHeight: 1.8, marginTop: 8 }}>项目三天内完成五个里程碑与两项增强的交付。本次评审按「是什么 → 怎么做 → 做得怎样」三条线展开，机制页保留实现细节，欢迎随时打断讨论。</Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ flex: 1, paddingLeft: 60, flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'space-between', paddingTop: 8, paddingBottom: 8 }}>
      <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'flex-start', gap: 28 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 44, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#B5D4F4' }}>01</Text>
        <Box style={{ flex: 1 }}>
